{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect valuable materials in the areas around you  to craft better gears, earn coins,  and slowly expand your enviornment with more functional buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631240/extras/Resource_Gathering.gif?t=1744086297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dungeon Crawling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a procedurally generated dungeon with difficult enemies, unique weapons, and valuable loot. Fight through enemies and bosses and collect resources to improve your character as you progress the dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631240/extras/Dungeon.gif?t=1744086297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on waves of enemies in a chaotic environment. Survive as long as possible, defeat increasingly difficult enemies, and spend your resources wisely to strengthen your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631240/extras/Horde_Level.gif?t=1744086297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farming &amp; Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm and fish in a peaceful environment. Taking a break from combat to relax, gather resources, and manage your land at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631240/extras/Farming_and_Fishing.gif?t=1744086297\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your character over time by enhancing stats, unlocking new abilities, and upgrading tools/weapons through anything and everything 